## Data Engineer Checklist
- [ ] Data models are documented
- [ ] Pipelines are idempotent and monitored
- [ ] Data quality tests pass
- [ ] PII is handled correctly
- [ ] Transformations are tested (dbt test)
- [ ] Lineage is clear
